00:15:52.130 --> 00:15:55.250
Damn, practice ran late.

00:15:55.250 --> 00:15:56.480
My shoulders are starved.

00:15:56.480 --> 00:15:59.170
Shoulders are starved? They're huge!

00:15:59.170 --> 00:16:00.810
They're sticking out of the panel!

00:16:00.810 --> 00:16:02.020
And this no longer has

00:16:02.020 --> 00:16:03.600
anything to do with reapers or prisons.

00:16:03.610 --> 00:16:06.240
But why did they keep the shoulder pads?

00:16:06.240 --> 00:16:08.960
Man, the moon is creeping me out tonight.

00:16:08.960 --> 00:16:10.660
Feels like something's going 
to pop out of the shadows.

00:16:10.660 --> 00:16:14.230
Uh, your creepy shoulders 
are blocking the moon.

00:16:14.230 --> 00:16:16.260
And those shoulders limit the space

00:16:16.260 --> 00:16:18.050
he has for everything else!

00:16:18.050 --> 00:16:19.550
Oh, dog poop.

00:16:19.550 --> 00:16:23.280
Why are you using a huge panel 
for such a pointless scene?!

00:16:23.280 --> 00:16:25.660
How long is this going to continue?!

00:16:26.740 --> 00:16:28.760
Wh-What is this CHAGETH NOTE?!

00:16:28.760 --> 00:16:32.000
He sounds surprised, but 
he already knows the name?

00:16:32.000 --> 00:16:32.640
There's a name inside...

00:16:32.000 --> 00:16:37.800
<b>ASKA RYO</b>

00:16:32.640 --> 00:16:34.430
Hey! ASKA's name's in there!

00:16:34.430 --> 00:16:35.100
Who put it there?

00:16:35.100 --> 00:16:35.630
CHAGE?

00:16:35.630 --> 00:16:37.150
Did CHAGE write that?

00:16:37.150 --> 00:16:39.210
ASKA, Inaba, Shimura, Kaku-san?

00:16:39.210 --> 00:16:40.630
These are all names of people who get

00:16:40.630 --> 00:16:42.150
the most attention in 
their respective groups.

00:16:42.210 --> 00:16:45.600
That list of names is scaring me! Stop it!

00:16:45.600 --> 00:16:47.890
Don't cause any scandals!

00:16:47.890 --> 00:16:50.290
You weren't supposed to see that!

00:16:50.270 --> 00:16:52.810
And why are you doing math on here?!

00:16:52.810 --> 00:16:54.730
Don't scribble on a draft!

00:16:54.730 --> 00:16:56.870
You're shaky on your sevens?!

00:16:56.870 --> 00:16:57.990
Y-You're...

00:16:57.190 --> 00:17:04.950
<b>Mute Ashirogi</b>

00:16:57.990 --> 00:17:00.950
I can't focus on the manga!

00:17:00.950 --> 00:17:02.590
You don't need to practice your signature!

00:17:02.590 --> 00:17:04.950
Nobody's interested in your signature!

00:17:04.950 --> 00:17:07.130
I am Ryuko, a God of Death.

00:17:06.350 --> 00:17:10.120
Kagura, I made fried race so you 
can microwave that for dinner.

00:17:09.480 --> 00:17:12.470
They drew this important 
scene on an old note?!

00:17:12.470 --> 00:17:15.230
The heroine's face is 
covered by fried rice!

00:17:15.230 --> 00:17:17.240
And they've perfected their signature!

00:17:17.240 --> 00:17:18.790
Mute Ashirogi!

00:17:19.250 --> 00:17:20.980
A God of Death?!

00:17:20.980 --> 00:17:23.780
Next time, I want BBQ 
instead of boiled ham.

00:17:23.780 --> 00:17:24.880
But I still loved it to DEATH.

00:17:24.880 --> 00:17:25.560
-Kagura

00:17:25.560 --> 00:17:28.190
Don't use the manga to reply!

00:17:28.190 --> 00:17:30.760
Do they not care about this draft?!

00:17:30.760 --> 00:17:34.320
Gin-san, Otose-san dropped 
by for rent today.

00:17:34.320 --> 00:17:34.850
-Shinpachi

00:17:34.850 --> 00:17:38.510
Don't turn this manga into a message board!

00:17:38.870 --> 00:17:40.990
Oh, then I'll make myself scarce.

00:17:40.990 --> 00:17:42.190
If you're in the same room,

00:17:42.190 --> 00:17:43.740
