00:17:44.680 --> 00:17:46.390
Wait up.

00:17:46.390 --> 00:17:49.640
What happened while those fools 
were talking to each other?

00:17:49.640 --> 00:17:51.870
We're back in a prison again!

00:17:52.270 --> 00:17:54.370
This was my only solution.

00:17:54.370 --> 00:17:56.140
I could never write someone's name

00:17:56.140 --> 00:17:57.940
in this notebook and CHAGE them.

00:17:57.940 --> 00:17:59.850
What does that even mean?

00:18:00.340 --> 00:18:04.120
I've fallen in love with 
both Ryuko and Wardena.

00:18:04.120 --> 00:18:06.720
